            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695870101",
                    "speaker": "Chasca",
                    "text": "I have to say, the vibe in this tavern's pretty chill. Everyone's having fun playing cards, and there's barely any quarrels. Tournaments over at the tribe? Yeah... those are a whole different story."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6958702",
            "initDialog": "695870201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695870201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let's play Genius Invokation TCG."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6958703",
            "initDialog": "695870301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695870301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "I've got other things to do right now..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "695870302",
                    "speaker": "Chasca",
                    "text": "Leaving already? Alright, well, I'm gonna try and pick up a few fancy cards to take back. I'm thinking \"Mom\" will love those shiny ones in particular..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6958704",
            "initDialog": "695870401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695870401",
                    "speaker": "Chasca",
                    "text": "Look, I might have come out on top, but only just. A hard-earned victory like this deserves a celebration. Pick your drink — it's on me."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6958705",
            "initDialog": "695870501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695870501",
                    "speaker": "Chasca",
                    "text": "You win this one. I made just one impatient blunder, but you seized your chance. Up for another round? I won't slip up like that again."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6958706",
            "initDialog": "695870601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695870601",
                    "speaker": "Chasca",
                    "text": "Ah, you wanna play? Sure, but I won't go easy on you."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6958708",
            "initDialog": "695870801",
            "dialogues": [
